    "updated_at": "2022-10-27T14:15:10Z",
    "body": "I was thinking that maybe we can move origin to HTML, but that does not immediately work as it's also cloned and such. Perhaps that is no longer necessary though if we keep track of it on the global as I don't think document's origin is directly exposed.\r\n\r\nInterdependencies between DOM and HTML are okay though, but if we can avoid them or at least plan for a way out that's always better.",
