    "body": "Hmm, another complication will be that adding origin, top-level site, etc to policy container will mean it is no longer able to be created with reasonable defaults.  We can use an opaque origin as a default, but that would change behavior.  So we will have to ensure that wherever a policy container is created these values are now available.\r\n\r\nEdit:  This is difficult because policy containers are created as defaults of other objects and so on.",
